    not_duplicate_of: []  # 29c2
    pr_ref:  # 29c2
    description: "Route transport-protocol values (`WS`/`LIVE`/`RPC`) are smuggled into the `http_method` verb field — a mechanism-vs-category leak. Surfaced by the 2026-07-07 route-surfacing fundamental-concept audit (lab notebook `route_surfacing_concept_audit_07072026.md`, suspect-pair C → verdict FOLD).\n\nINVARIANT: `http_method` carries only real HTTP verbs (or None); transport lives in a dedicated `route_protocol` axis.\n\nCurrent state (violated):\n- `routes.py:77-81` normalizes ONLY the `WS` sentinel into `protocol='websocket'`. `LIVE` (Phoenix LiveView, elixir.py:504 — WebSocket transport) and `RPC` (grpc.py:956) fall through to `protocol='http'` — LiveView/gRPC misclassified as HTTP method-bearing routes.\n- A protocol axis ALREADY exists: `protocol_origins.py` registers `websocket`/`grpc`/`http`. grpc route synthetics DOUBLE-ENCODE: `protocol_origin='grpc'` AND `http_method='RPC'` on one symbol, and `route_of`'s derived `protocol='http'` CONTRADICTS the symbol's own `protocol_origin`.\n\nFix (FOLD, done right — the three completeness requirements the audit flagged for target-D's `route_protocol`):\n1. COVERAGE — cover the full transport value space (WS/LIVE/RPC …), not only WS.\n2. RECONCILE — reuse `protocol_origins.py`'s vocabulary or document precisely why route-endpoint-transport (a Class-A endpoint property) is a distinct axis from `protocol_origin` (Class-B synthesis provenance).\n3. CONSUMER MIGRATION (lockstep) — the raw-sentinel consumers that do NOT go through `route_of` and will break if the sentinel leaves `http_method`: entrypoints.py:518 + :1266 (`if method=='WS'` → WEBSOCKET_HANDLER), route_handler.py:607 (`http_method=='LIVE'` → LiveView flag), cli.py:2114/2159 (cmd_routes renders raw method). Producer-side: py.py:1466 WebSocketRoute, elixir.py:504 `live`, grpc.py:956 emit the transport into `route_protocol` and drop the sentinel from `http_method`.\nAdd a value-set property test: `http_method` never contains a transport token once producers migrate.\n\nScope note: WI-tosul Phase-1b-α REGISTERS the `route_protocol` MetaKeySpec and keeps `route_of` WS-only (register-scoped per decision-register target-D(ii)); THIS item is the producer-side migration + LIVE/RPC completion + protocol_origin reconciliation that the register explicitly deferred (\"producer emission work deferred; scope, not build\")."  # 29c2
    fields:  # 29c2
      statement: "http_method carries only real HTTP verbs (or None); route transport (WS/LIVE/RPC) lives in a dedicated route_protocol axis, not smuggled into the verb field."  # 29c2
      root_cause: "routes.py:77-81 normalizes only WS out of http_method (LIVE/RPC leak as protocol=http); a route_protocol axis was never built and the existing protocol_origin axis is not reconciled (grpc route double-encodes protocol_origin=grpc AND http_method=RPC)."  # 29c2
